        <mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;i&gt;Ticks mark January 1. The invoices and the shipments end on 2026-12-31, the last day of fiscal 2026, so 2026 Q4 is the latest complete quarter. The ledger runs 526 rows further, to 2027-02-23, but they are supplier payments for earlier purchases: no sales, no shipments and so no margin. The close, JE-2026-000296, is posted on the last day of the year, inside Q4.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="304" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
